etchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 4:32 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:25</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
